Based on Wine / Proton Wine 11.0-2 at
https://github.com/The412Banner/proton-wine/tree/dcc50c55e2a4dbd06610e5b45d8872bc6f048633
with its pinned Android ARM64EC vendor patches and Aura wait/tick patches.
Wine and its contributors retain their copyright. This correction is by Aura
contributors, 2026, under LGPL-2.1-or-later. See COPYING.LIB and
wine-arm64ec-breakpoint.patch. Rebuild instructions and pinned inputs are in
tools/arm64ec/arm64ec-breakpoint/README.md and build.json in the source tree.

Wine's ARM64EC process_breakpoint SEH handler receives an AMD64-compatible
context. Advance Rip / ARM64EC_NT_CONTEXT.Pc at 0xf8, instead of modifying the
floating-point exception fields at 0x108. Retain the original four-byte ARM64
instruction step, exception disposition, debug-port query and exception dispatch.
No game file is modified or included. Android gameplay verification is pending.
